stateDiagram-v2
    %% Ownership after refactor phases 1-3 (docs/design/state-machine-ownership.md).
    %% Transition labels are tagged with the task that WRITES the target state:
    %%   [ctrl] = controllerTask, the single writer of the WiFi/idle group AND the
    %%            tag-detection states. It writes them in response to events:
    %%            syncTask posts WiFi events; nfcTask posts tag-fact events
    %%            (TagDetecting/TagBlank/AwaitConfirm/FormatConfirmed/TagValid/
    %%            TagReadErr/ReturnToIdle) from its own local NfcPhase machine.
    %%   [sync] = syncTask writes directly — the weigh states (phase 4 will move these).
    %%   [nfc]  = nfcTask writes directly — ONLY ReconcilingMainSection->Present now
    %%            (phase 4 will move it; it is the last state written by two tasks).
    %% "idle*" = the controller picks Idle (joined) vs IdleNoWiFi (SoftAP).

    [*] --> Boot

    Boot --> WiFiSetupMode: [ctrl] no saved creds -> portal opens
    Boot --> Idle: [ctrl] saved creds join immediately
    note right of Boot
        nfcTask does NOT poll the reader in Boot or
        WiFiSetupMode (the SoftAP-RF bus-hang fix,
        9280424); it holds local phase Waiting there.
    end note

    WiFiSetupMode --> Idle: [ctrl] credentials accepted, joined
    WiFiSetupMode --> IdleNoWiFi: [ctrl] portal timeout -> SoftAP fallback

    Idle --> TagDetecting: [ctrl] nfc reports a tag (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> TagDetecting: [ctrl] nfc reports a tag (1st read)
    IdleNoWiFi --> Idle: [ctrl] station WiFi comes up later

    TagDetecting --> Idle: [ctrl] false trigger (idle*)
    TagDetecting --> TagReadError: [ctrl] 3 reads, inconsistent/corrupt
    TagDetecting --> BlankTagFound: [ctrl] 3 reads confirm, unformatted
    TagDetecting --> ValidTagFound: [ctrl] 3 reads confirm, valid OPT

    TagReadError --> Idle: [ctrl] tag removed (idle*)

    BlankTagFound --> AwaitingFormatConfirm: [ctrl] prompt + 5s countdown
    note right of AwaitingFormatConfirm
        Confirm-by-inaction: live 5..4..3..2..1 countdown,
        LED blinks accelerating. Remove to cancel; leave
        in place to 0 to confirm. nfcTask times it locally.
    end note
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> FormattingAndRegistering: [ctrl] countdown 0, tag present
    AwaitingFormatConfirm --> Idle: [ctrl] removed during countdown (idle*)
    FormattingAndRegistering --> ValidTagFound: [ctrl] formatted (blank, nil UUID)

    ValidTagFound --> Present: [sync] blank -> mint UUID + stub record (needs onboarding)
    ValidTagFound --> ForeignTagFound: [sync] uuid not in local store (valid, unregistered)
    ValidTagFound --> WeighingAndSync: [sync] uuid matches a known spool

    ForeignTagFound --> RegisteringForeignTag: [sync] adopt product + create record from tag's Main
    RegisteringForeignTag --> WeighingAndSync: [sync] local record created
    ForeignTagFound --> Idle: [ctrl] tag removed (nfc Held -> ReturnToIdle, idle*)
    RegisteringForeignTag --> Idle: [ctrl] tag removed mid-registration (idle*)

    WeighingAndSync --> Present: [sync] weigh once; write tag Aux; append weigh event

    Present --> ReconcilingMainSection: [sync] 1s poll detects a local-store edit
    ReconcilingMainSection --> Present: [nfc] tag Main rewritten, snapshot updated
    Present --> Idle: [ctrl] tag removed, 2 misses (nfc Held -> ReturnToIdle, idle*)
